    },
    {
      "post_id": "553279976401666049",
      "text": "@DougSaunders @left_liberal @facepalmidiots What happened was awful, my heart breaks for them and their families. but I wouldn't romanticise",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 20:00:00 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532798189516923e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552920757076889600",
      "text": "The cover mocks Houellebecq, but the book isn’t “Islamophobic” by any means, nor was that their point. @DougSaunders @mdentandt",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 20:12:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528426422169887e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552920891277848576",
      "text": "It’s quite clear that Houellebecq actually admires Islam. @DougSaunders @mdentandt",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 20:13:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529207570768896e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552921317289103360",
      "text": "(I should say, NOW admires it.) @DougSaunders @mdentandt",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 20:14:49 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529208912778486e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553268844035207169",
      "text": "@DougSaunders discriminating. I think they are offensive. I also said I still support their FOE @left_liberal @its_georgie101",
